  "translation": "Kwathi, esidila ukumkani, yena wakhalaza kuye ukumkani, wathi: “Incinyana yakho yaphuma phakathi kwemfazwe; nanga-ke, umntu wasuka watshikila, waza umntu wafika kum, wathi: Gcina ⟨את⟩ lo umntu; ukuba ibalekelwa nangaliphi ixesha, umphefumlo wakho uza kuba ngowakhe endaweni yomphefumlo wakhe, okanye italente yesiliva uza kulinganisa.”",
